"e.app</code> on macOS). From a source checkout see docs/DEPENDENCIES.md."
" Levels are digital (dBFS) unless a calibration is provided; RoomScope n"
"ever reports dB SPL."
msgstr ""
"<b>RoomScope {version}</b><br>오픈소스이며 DAW에 의존하지 않는 녹음 환경 분석기입니다.<br><br>L"
