"s. NumPy, SciPy, matplotlib, soundfile (libsndfile, LGPL-2.1) and soundd"
"evice (PortAudio) are used under their respective licenses.<br><br>A des"
"ktop bundle ships a <code>THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/</code> directory next to"
" the executable (and inside <code>RoomScope.app</code> on macOS). From a"
" source checkout see docs/DEPENDENCIES.md. Levels are digital (dBFS) unl"
